QtZpl DataMatrix C40/Text compaction

The C40/Text character mappings and terminal-triplet rules in
src/barcode_encoders.cpp follow ZXing's C40Encoder and TextEncoder:
https://github.com/zxing/zxing/tree/master/core/src/main/java/com/google/zxing/datamatrix/encoder

