QtZpl implements a bounded native candidate-size search. Proven ASCII and GS1
module vectors are retained when ASCII fits the selected symbol; C40 or Text
can select a smaller symbol or satisfy an explicit capacity constraint.
This is not a full implementation of mixed-mode ECC200 optimization: X12,
EDIFACT and Base256 choices remain outside this compaction extension.
